  "strategy": "Client-only SpriteSource composes installed texture pixels in memory. The owned JAR distributes models and source code, no Minecraft/Create PNGs. Matching ore/base pixels become installed blackstone side/top; differing pixels retain the installed ore artwork. Existing selected resource packs remain inputs.",
  "generation": "Accepted native OreFeature.doPlace writes whose actual replaced state is minecraft:blackstone select matching owned variants for ten vanilla/Create/Galosphere ores. For native ReplaceBlobsFeature configurations that replace deepslate with blackstone, preexisting recognized ore inside the unchanged native footprint is retained as its blackstone variant. This covers noise-stage large veins. Original blob anchor search, radii/random draws and unrelated blob configurations remain unchanged. Existing saved FULL chunks receive no retrogen.",
